00:04:20.580 --> 00:04:44.960
So it is kind of like combat vehicle racing in a way that we haven't, I mean, we've had it, but like not in the, not in the way that this game is doing it, where it kind of, this is like if RC Pro-Am was like thrown into outer space, added some jumps and, uh, did a, maybe RC Pro-Am had digitized voices, but there is a digitized voice in this game, which is pretty cool.

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:47.180
