00:04:47.800 --> 00:05:01.360
Right. The most important thing that's going to make or break any racing game, but specifically one that takes the RC Pro-Am isometric approach and puts it in space is how it feels to drive one of these bad boys.

00:05:02.060 --> 00:05:06.160
