00:06:58.000 --> 00:07:10.700
Even if you successfully finish the race means that, uh, you will have to use some of your winning money, uh, your prize money to heal your ship or else you run the risk of permanently damaging your ship.

00:07:10.980 --> 00:07:18.140
That, that combat aspect is something that we haven't seen mixed with, um, these other like RC pro am style racing games.

00:07:18.480 --> 00:07:27.440
